      "refersTo": "button-ghost",
      "description": "Ghost for tertiary actions; danger is red text, solid red only for the final destructive step.",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-ghost\">Dismiss</button><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-danger\">Stop</button></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:var(--r-2,6px);border:1px solid var(--line-2,#2f2f32);background:var(--panel,#111112);font:500 13px/1 Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg,#ededef);cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms var(--ease-out,cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)),background-color 120ms ease}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--hover,#1c1c1e)}.ds-btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--acc,#2fd8ee);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-ghost{border-color:transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--fg-2,#a3a3aa)}.ds-btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--fg,#ededef);background:var(--hover,#1c1c1e)}.ds-btn-danger{color:var(--err,#ff6262)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "32px field on the page colour; focus turns the border cyan with a soft halo.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-in\" placeholder=\"Filter services\">",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-in{height:32px;border:1px solid var(--line-2,#2f2f32);border-radius:var(--r-2,6px);background:var(--page,#0a0a0a);padding:0 10px;font:13px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg,#ededef);outline:none;transition:border-color 120ms ease,box-shadow 120ms ease}.ds-in::placeholder{color:var(--fg-3,#8a8a92)}.ds-in:focus-visible{border-color:var(--acc,#2fd8ee);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--acc,#2fd8ee) 22%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "segmented",
      "description": "Raised track with a panel-coloured thumb that slides between options.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">24h</button><button>7d</button><button>30d</button></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-seg{display:inline-flex;padding:2px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--raised,#18181a);border:1px solid var(--line,#232325)}.ds-seg button{height:26px;padding:0 10px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;font:500 12.5px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg-3,#8a8a92);cursor:pointer;transition:color 150ms ease,background-color 200ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-seg button:hover{color:var(--fg,#ededef)}.ds-seg button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:var(--fg,#ededef);background:var(--panel,#111112);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12),0 0 0 1px var(--line-2,#2f2f32)}.ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--acc,#2fd8ee);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tags and Status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag",
      "description": "Outline tag; status tags are a 14% wash of their colour. Status dot beside a label.",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\"><span class=\"ds-tag\">v3.2</span><span class=\"ds-tag ds-ok\">healthy</span><span class=\"ds-tag ds-warn\">degraded</span><span class=\"ds-tag ds-err\">down</span><span class=\"ds-st\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span>Running</span></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:20px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:var(--r-1,4px);border:1px solid var(--line-2,#2f2f32);font:500 11.5px/1 Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg-2,#a3a3aa)}.ds-ok{--c:var(--ok,#3fcf7f)}.ds-warn{--c:var(--warn,#f2b13c)}.ds-err{--c:var(--err,#ff6262)}.ds-tag.ds-ok,.ds-tag.ds-warn,.ds-tag.ds-err{border-color:transparent;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c) 14%,transparent);color:var(--c)}.ds-st{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font:12.5px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg-2,#a3a3aa)}.ds-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok,#3fcf7f)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Panel with Metric Rows",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Hairline panel at 8px radius; mono tabular values under small labels.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-cell\"><div class=\"ds-ml\">CPU</div><div class=\"ds-mv\">42<span class=\"ds-u\">%</span></div></div><div class=\"ds-cell\"><div class=\"ds-ml\">Memory</div><div class=\"ds-mv ds-warn\">18.4<span class=\"ds-u\">GB</span></div></div><div class=\"ds-cell\"><div class=\"ds-ml\">Uptime</div><div class=\"ds-mv\">12d 4h</div></div></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));background:var(--panel,#111112);border:1px solid var(--line,#232325);border-radius:var(--r-3,8px);box-shadow:var(--sh-1)}.ds-cell{padding:14px 16px}.ds-cell+.ds-cell{border-left:1px solid var(--line,#232325)}.ds-ml{font:11.5px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg-3,#8a8a92);margin-bottom:3px}.ds-mv{font:500 22px/1.2 \"Geist Mono\",ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:var(--c,var(--fg,#ededef))}.ds-mv.ds-warn{--c:var(--warn,#f2b13c)}.ds-u{color:var(--fg-3,#8a8a92);font-size:.78em;margin-left:1px;letter-spacing:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Mono wordmark, 34px items; the active item is raised with a cyan icon.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-side\"><div class=\"ds-wm\"><b>o</b>jee<span>.console</span></div><a class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"ds-i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Overview</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav\"><svg class=\"ds-i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"/></svg><span>Machines</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav\"><svg class=\"ds-i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 17l6-6-6-6M12 19h8\"/></svg><span>Terminal</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-side{width:232px;padding:16px 12px;background:var(--page,#0a0a0a);border-right:1px solid var(--line,#232325);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.ds-wm{font:600 16px/1 \"Geist Mono\",ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:-.03em;padding:6px 8px 18px;color:var(--fg,#ededef)}.ds-wm b{color:var(--acc,#2fd8ee);font-weight:700}.ds-wm span{color:var(--fg-3,#8a8a92);font-weight:500}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;height:34px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:var(--r-2,6px);color:var(--fg-2,#a3a3aa);font:500 14px Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease,color 120ms ease}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--hover,#1c1c1e);color:var(--fg,#ededef)}.ds-nav[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--raised,#18181a);color:var(--fg,#ededef)}.ds-nav[aria-current=\"page\"] .ds-i{color:var(--acc,#2fd8ee)}.ds-i{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.75;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Toast",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "popover",
      "description": "Floating card: line-2 border plus the float shadow, status dot, title, detail.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toast\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span><div><b>Backup finished</b><span>disinteg · 2.4 GB in 3m 12s</span></div></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-toast{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px;width:340px;padding:12px;border-radius:var(--r-4,10px);background:var(--panel,#111112);border:1px solid var(--line-2,#2f2f32);box-shadow:var(--sh-3);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-toast .ds-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok,#3fcf7f);margin-top:6px}.ds-toast b{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--fg,#ededef)}.ds-toast span:not(.ds-dot){display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--fg-2,#a3a3aa);margin-top:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Switch",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "switch",
      "description": "36 by 20 track; on is status green, knob slides on ease-out.",
      "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px\"><button class=\"ds-sw\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"on\"></button><button class=\"ds-sw\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"off\"></button></div>",
      "css": ":host,.ds{--page:#0a0a0a;--panel:#111112;--raised:#18181a;--hover:#1c1c1e;--line:#232325;--line-2:#2f2f32;--fg:#ededef;--fg-2:#a3a3aa;--fg-3:#8a8a92;--inv-fg:#0a0a0a;--acc:#2fd8ee;--ok:#3fcf7f;--warn:#f2b13c;--err:#ff6262;--sh-1:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4);--sh-3:0 28px 70px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.75);--r-1:4px;--r-2:6px;--r-3:8px;--r-4:10px;--ease-out:cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1);font-family:Geist,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fg)}.ds-sw{width:36px;height:20px;border:0;padding:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--line-2,#2f2f32);position:relative;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease}.ds-sw::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transition:transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-sw[aria-checked=\"true\"]{background:var(--ok,#3fcf7f)}.ds-sw[aria-checked=\"true\"]::after{transform:translateX(16px)}.ds-sw:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--acc,#2fd8ee);outline-offset:2px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Quiet Console",
    "overview": "ojee.console is one person's control room for their machines, services and agents, drawn to the grade of Vercel, Cloudflare and Linear. It is a modern tech product, not a themed instrument: neutral grey planes separated by hairlines, a single electric-cyan accent that marks *where you are* and *what is focused*, and colour otherwise spent only on status (ok, warn, err). Dark is the hero theme and the one people see first; light is first-class and gets its own tuned values rather than an inversion. Everything is flat and two-dimensional: no 3D, no glass, no gradients as decoration.\n\nDensity is high but calm. The body is 14px Geist with most chrome at 12.5–13px; every number, ID, time and the wordmark is set in Geist Mono with tabular figures so values never jitter while they update. Surfaces sit on a 4px grid, corners step through five small radii (4/6/8/10/14), and motion is short and decelerating (120–200ms on `--ease-out`, 260–380ms on `--ease-drawer` for things that travel in from an edge).\n\nThe system lives in one vendored file, `public/ojee-ui3.css` (identical to the shared `ojee-ui/ojee-ui3.css`), plus self-hosted variable woff2 fonts and the `icons3.svg` sprite. `public/app.css` only places the shell's own pages. Modules never patch the shared file; they scope their own rules under their root.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Dark hero, first-class light; theme set by `<html data-theme>` or the OS.",
      "Neutral greys plus one accent (cyan `#2fd8ee` dark / `#0e7490` light); status colours ok/warn/err are the only other hues.",
      "Geist for UI, Geist Mono tabular for numbers, IDs, times and the wordmark.",
      "1px hairlines (`--line`, `--line-2`) do the structural work; shadows are light and reserved for things that float.",
      "Radii 4/6/8/10/14, 4px grid, decelerating motion, no 3D.",
      "Layout by container queries on `app` (the `<body>`): 700 / 1000 / 1200.",
      "Lucide-style 16px line icons at stroke 1.75."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Accent Rule",
        "body": "Cyan marks location and focus only. It is never a decorative fill, a chart series, or a second brand colour; the default primary action is the inverted neutral button, and `.btn.acc` is a rare exception.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Status-Only Colour Rule",
        "body": "Any hue other than the accent means ok, warn or err. If something is coloured and is not a status, it is wrong.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Tuned Themes Rule",
        "body": "Every neutral and status token has its own light value; light is never produced by inverting dark.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Values Rule",
        "body": "Numbers, IDs, times, durations and the wordmark are Geist Mono with tabular figures. Prose and labels are never mono.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Small Steps Rule",
        "body": "Hierarchy comes from half-pixel size steps, weight (400/500/600) and the three foreground greys, not from big display type. Nothing in the app chrome exceeds 24px except a 32px hero metric.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Border-Plus-Float Rule",
        "body": "A popover always has both a `--line-2` border and `--sh-3`. Neither alone.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Plane Rule",
        "body": "No 3D, no perspective, no tilt, no glass on content surfaces. The only blur in the system is the mobile tab bar, and it drops to solid page under `prefers-reduced-transparency`.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** take every colour from a token (`--page`, `--panel`, `--raised`, `--hover`, `--line`, `--line-2`, `--fg`, `--fg-2`, `--fg-3`, `--acc`, `--ok`, `--warn`, `--err`) so both themes and all three accents work.",
      "**Do** set numbers, IDs, times and durations in Geist Mono with tabular figures (`.m`, `.mv`, `.num`).",
      "**Do** use the inverted neutral `.btn.pri` for the primary action and keep cyan for location and focus.",
      "**Do** give every floating surface a 1px `--line-2` border plus `--sh-3`.",
      "**Do** write layout queries as `@container app (min-width: 700px | 1000px | 1200px)`, not viewport media queries (sheets excepted).",
      "**Do** keep radii on the 4/6/8/10/14 scale and spacing on the 4px grid.",
      "**Do** animate only `transform` and `opacity` on `--ease-out` (`cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)`) for UI and `--ease-drawer` (`cubic-bezier(.32,.72,0,1)`) for edge-entering surfaces, and provide a reduced-motion path.",
      "**Do** self-host fonts and icons; vendor `ojee-ui3.css`, `fonts/` and `icons3.svg` rather than fetching them.",
      "**Do** add module fixes in the module's own scoped CSS; never edit `ojee-ui3.css` to solve a module problem."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce a second accent or any decorative hue; colour other than cyan means ok, warn or err.",
      "**Don't** add 3D, perspective, tilt, glassmorphism on content, or decorative gradients.",
      "**Don't** use uppercase tracked labels or eyebrow text above headings; section titles are 13px/600 sentence case.",
      "**Don't** set prose or labels in mono, or numbers in proportional figures.",
      "**Don't** use filled or glyph icons (text characters standing in for icons); use the line sprite.",
      "**Don't** rely on a shadow alone to separate a floating surface from a dark page.",
      "**Don't** animate the command palette, or animate layout properties (width/height/top) outside the segmented indicator and bar fill.",
      "**Don't** produce the light theme by inverting dark values."
    ]
  }
}